{"version":1,"content":"<p>面對日益猖獗、手段不斷升級的網絡詐騙活動，東盟正在加強與Google及其他科技企業的合作。2026年11月10日，東盟基金會（ASEAN Foundation）與Google旗下慈善機構Google.org在菲律賓馬尼拉正式推出名為「Scam Ready ASEAN」的區域性反詐騙數字資源平台，旨在幫助東南亞民眾識別網絡詐騙、了解防範方法，並在遭遇詐騙時找到正確的舉報渠道。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586070.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:23:53.012430+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T12:05:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033343+00:00","content_hash":"cb624ef0e82f0babff6533397e8b2d48e0c42a14f08fb4b12c5b37c40c6e04da","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}